---
title: Recipes
layout: base.njk
section: cookbook
permalink: /cookbook/recipes/
description: "The full list of the 126 recipes in the Mathematician's Cookbook, by chapter."
---
<div class="wrap page">
  <p class="crumb"><a href="/cookbook/">The Mathematician’s Cookbook</a></p>
  <h1>All 126 recipes</h1>
  <p class="lede">The index of the 4th edition, with page numbers. Names are as hand-written in the book, spelling included.</p>
  <div class="cb-chapters">
  {%- for c in recipes %}
    <section>
      <h2>{{ c.chapterEn }} <small lang="de">({{ c.chapter }})</small></h2>
      <ul>
      {%- for r in c.recipes %}
        <li><div>{{ r.name }}{% if r.alias %} <small>({{ r.alias }})</small>{% endif %}</div><span>{{ r.page }}</span></li>
      {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>
  {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/cookbook/#buy">Buy the book</a></p>
</div>
